  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adeba Nature Beauty Products Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adeba Nature Limited (Adeba) is a growing woman-led premium natural beauty and cosmetics company that uses bioactive ingredients from West African medicinal plants. Adeba will focus on diversifying its product lines and increasing production and distribution of its products by upgrading and equipping the production plant, developing a small research and product development laboratory, and increasing its marketing activities.</narrative>
  </description>
